// woodcore:object heading title
== Occupational safety during construction
// woodcore:/object title

// woodcore:object text p1
The SUVA regulations must be observed. Responsibility lies not with the engineer but with the site management and the contractor. Scaffolding, temporary guardrails and propping are provided by the contractor in compliance with the regulations in force.
// woodcore:/object p1
